  "question": {
    "text": "If the straight line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is perpendicular to the line passing through the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then <math><mi>&#946;</mi></math> equals :"
  },
  "options": [
